{title: Harbour Lights}
{artist: The Quiet Harbour}
{key: G}
{capo: 2}
{define: Gadd9 base-fret 1 frets 3 2 0 2 0 3}
{define: C base-fret 1 frets x 3 2 0 1 0}

{start_of_verse}
[G]Harbour lights are [Em]calling, [C]soft against the [D]rain
[Gadd9]Every ship that [C]leaves us [D]sails back home a[G]gain
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[C]Shine on, [G/B]shine [Am7]on
[N.C.]Hold the [D7sus4]line till [G]dawn
{end_of_chorus}
